Spoilers?

Well, this isn't such a good idea.  First, you are not allowed to
genocide shopkeepers --- it just can't be done.  Also, if you are 
polymorphed while you genocide your own character class, you will 
get the message `you feel dead inside', and immediately after you
finish reading the scroll, you will die.  However you can survive 
if you have an amulet of life saving --- you will even survive if
and when you return to human form.  I think this isn't the way it
should work --- certainly an amulet of life saving shouldn't make
any difference, and you should always die when you return to your
human form, and not immediately.  Does this annoy anybody but me?
